            <div xml:id="m-db95e4b0-4a9c-4e65-ba10-d13ecc892e5b">
              <lg xml:id="m-758e3c13-0941-43c1-8835-ef7497603350">
                <l xml:id="m-9612b0ef-9ae2-47c6-b8a6-c49253c01247" facs="#m-7dfa8c31-004a-48c5-a155-f2810112e9e8" label="ambiguous">Credo. — III.</l><l xml:id="m-e3e94526-c906-4c73-b400-6069a9c41a80" facs="#m-52beefe8-135c-40bc-af06-5c3bd2a45b41" label="ambiguous">es</l><l xml:id="m-158bce37-bce6-454d-a5ca-cde2f79f1be3" facs="#m-6040c0d0-0ce9-420c-a89c-bcf21e475a6b" label="lyrics-like">que procé-dit. Qui cum Pâtre et Fi-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-57d60949-1c6e-4861-9f15-c75af8a777b9" facs="#m-68b22620-2723-42ef-9b58-485a2a72de7d" label="lyrics-like">simul adorá¬</l><l xml:id="m-3448f07d-743c-451f-9bb4-dc9f8f7eff0e" facs="#m-dba8d147-58d8-4847-8d84-06e60f954fa8" label="lyrics-like">tur, et conglo-ri-ficátur: qui locútus est per Prophé-tas.</l><l xml:id="m-343ce469-40bf-4b69-9aed-0a2ae78f8019" facs="#m-6d15a5c2-bdf6-4d81-8a48-860a768ee0d5" label="lyrics-like">Et únam sánctam cathó-licam et apostó-li-cam Ecclé¬</l><l xml:id="m-860363e4-3215-49d4-94cf-96410426d733" facs="#m-fd788476-17e2-47e4-90f3-fde606441095" label="lyrics-like">si-am. Confí-te-or únum baptísma</l><l xml:id="m-76d09c57-62fe-49b5-b00e-c2d8772bd225" facs="#m-e957e6b8-9e26-415f-84cd-8d7c4e75b299" label="lyrics-like">in remissi-ónem pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-9bedf3ff-4f5d-4f1b-9cff-67b8f38a91a4" facs="#m-09023d89-a8ee-4b19-84ed-804b5f8d3212" label="lyrics-like">catórum. Et exspécto resurrecti-ónem mortu-órum.</l><l xml:id="m-03c715d7-420e-461d-88ae-8a4b5de08d94" facs="#m-31548fff-4558-42a7-8a55-1990b5e97a90" label="ambiguous">Et</l><l xml:id="m-0cc36ef5-cd17-40a2-836a-c7fa990eda1f" facs="#m-20e090c4-5acf-4b8f-8cac-9632a33ff8af" label="lyrics-like">ví-tam ventú-ri saécu-li. A- men.</l><l xml:id="m-1b00d021-5713-42a5-8c1e-b66f988da986" facs="#m-a54de9a6-115c-4339-a82d-7f8d20bbc357" label="ambiguous">III.</l><l xml:id="m-76cc204c-5b97-438a-971f-ecf4a18e7a1a" facs="#m-7e54518e-5f5a-463e-8e41-c662d0a26a31" label="ambiguous">XVII. c.</l><l xml:id="m-5e103bda-748e-4d77-8ed7-e4e60265de95" facs="#m-dcaf9f80-623d-4fde-83e3-eea804328174" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-7164f29d-5f17-4080-be7f-cdb1acfe7661" facs="#m-6cb534e7-f39d-40c2-ab20-a8a1ee85c32e" label="lyrics-like">Rédo in únum Dé¬ um, Pá̂trem omnipoténtem,</l><l xml:id="m-282e1b8f-bfee-4c42-91c3-71f0b700c325" facs="#m-2ddb9cf4-c5bc-42eb-b910-a1c4521866f7" label="lyrics-like">factó-rem caéli et térrae, vi-sibi-li-um ómni- um,</l><l xml:id="m-3391368b-1885-49b2-b110-a98a688852cd" facs="#m-a615e3ac-d995-45f4-9aeb-ef665fde05de" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-6e2e1222-7527-487b-83c7-59d79369fd6d" facs="#m-854552ee-bf69-4fcc-9a1b-05cffcb43c81" label="lyrics-like">invi-sibí¬</l><l xml:id="m-afffc780-55a0-4f00-8c40-2f23a2bbb4e2" facs="#m-b5113b37-3fa5-4b66-ab61-740224c31f28" label="lyrics-like">Et in únum Dóminum Jé-sum Chrí¬</l><l xml:id="m-8b0b6caa-45ce-40a6-96e1-154dc44a7e63" facs="#m-f8019df3-e271-491a-91d5-76a785c437b0" label="ambiguous">li-um.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
